[
  {
    "id": "200001",
    "track_id": "20",
    "begin_time": "00:00:01,200",
    "end_time": "00:00:06,466",
    "content": "为什么……明明没有伤害别人，却还要被囚禁？"
  },
  {
    "id": "200002",
    "track_id": "20",
    "begin_time": "00:00:06,733",
    "end_time": "00:00:12,300",
    "content": "“那你为什么藏着自己的爪子？为什么不真的让他们害怕你呢？”"
  },
  {
    "id": "200003",
    "track_id": "20",
    "begin_time": "00:00:13,000",
    "end_time": "00:00:15,866",
    "content": "是啊……既然不相信我……"
  },
  {
    "id": "200004",
    "track_id": "20",
    "begin_time": "00:00:16,133",
    "end_time": "00:00:17,800",
    "content": "那就都受死吧！"
  },
  {
    "id": "200005",
    "track_id": "20",
    "begin_time": "00:00:20,533",
    "end_time": "00:00:26,500",
    "content": "“裘卡，控制你自己！好好想想，你究竟想成为怎样的精灵！”"
  },
  {
    "id": "210001",
    "track_id": "21",
    "begin_time": "00:00:01,566",
    "end_time": "00:00:06,566",
    "content": "他们都不和我玩，我好孤独……好孤独……"
  },
  {
    "id": "210002",
    "track_id": "21",
    "begin_time": "00:00:07,566",
    "end_time": "00:00:13,333",
    "content": "“让他们也感受你的剧毒吧，这样，他们就会理解你了”"
  },
  {
    "id": "210003",
    "track_id": "21",
    "begin_time": "00:00:13,566",
    "end_time": "00:00:22,966",
    "content": "对啊……只要大家都和我一样，就不会再害怕我了……我们就能成为朋友了，对不对？"
  },
  {
    "id": "210004",
    "track_id": "21",
    "begin_time": "00:00:23,566",
    "end_time": "00:00:30,966",
    "content": "请原谅我！我只是……只是想和你们在一起玩……你们会明白的……"
  },
  {
    "id": "210005",
    "track_id": "21",
    "begin_time": "00:00:31,033",
    "end_time": "00:00:37,066",
    "content": "“珂赛特，醒醒！朋友是靠真心换的……不是强求来的！”"
  },
  {
    "id": "220001",
    "track_id": "22",
    "begin_time": "00:00:01,233",
    "end_time": "00:00:10,700",
    "content": "我曾竭力为众人争取公平，但最终才明白，没有人真正渴望纯粹的公平"
  },
  {
    "id": "220002",
    "track_id": "22",
    "begin_time": "00:00:10,200",
    "end_time": "00:00:18,666",
    "content": "“你认为他们在乎的真是公平吗？还是只是伪装下的贪欲？”"
  },
  {
    "id": "220003",
    "track_id": "22",
    "begin_time": "00:00:18,466",
    "end_time": "00:00:27,000",
    "content": "与其追求虚妄的平衡，还不如放弃这一切，随性而行！"
  },
  {
    "id": "220004",
    "track_id": "22",
    "begin_time": "00:00:27,533",
    "end_time": "00:00:34,566",
    "content": "希露德，住手吧！倾听你内心深处，那未曾熄灭的秩序之音"
  },
  {
    "id": "230001",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:00,500",
    "end_time": "00:00:04,500",
    "content": "200年前，当那只怪物侵蚀学院之时"
  },
  {
    "id": "230002",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:05,167",
    "end_time": "00:00:06,733",
    "content": "我尝试保护大家"
  },
  {
    "id": "230003",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:08,200",
    "end_time": "00:00:13,467",
    "content": "但冥古龙的噩梦精灵大军，如潮水一般……无穷无尽"
  },
  {
    "id": "230004",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:14,500",
    "end_time": "00:00:17,900",
    "content": "即使是我，也难以阻挡"
  },
  {
    "id": "230005",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:19,333",
    "end_time": "00:00:22,567",
    "content": "我只能眼睁睁地看着学院被一步步吞没"
  },
  {
    "id": "230006",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:23,700",
    "end_time": "00:00:27,333",
    "content": "在万念俱灰时，一位少年现身"
  },
  {
    "id": "230007",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:28,467",
    "end_time": "00:00:30,033",
    "content": "光芒闪耀间"
  },
  {
    "id": "230008",
    "track_id": "23",
    "begin_time": "00:00:30,767",
    "end_time": "00:00:32,367",
    "content": "他举起了星盘"
  },
  {
    "id": "350001",
    "track_id": "35",
    "begin_time": "00:01:16,533",
    "end_time": "00:01:17,566",
    "content": "又见面了"
  },
  {
    "id": "350002",
    "track_id": "35",
    "begin_time": "00:01:18,266",
    "end_time": "00:01:24,200",
    "content": "欢迎卡洛西亚未来的魔法之星们！"
  },
  {
    "id": "360001",
    "track_id": "36",
    "begin_time": "00:00:00,333",
    "end_time": "00:00:05,033",
    "content": "同学们，你们承接着浩瀚的历史"
  },
  {
    "id": "360002",
    "track_id": "36",
    "begin_time": "00:00:05,633",
    "end_time": "00:00:09,200",
    "content": "亦将开创璀璨的明天"
  },
  {
    "id": "360003",
    "track_id": "36",
    "begin_time": "00:00:10,133",
    "end_time": "00:00:14,866",
    "content": "以往日荣光，与未来的希冀为名"
  },
  {
    "id": "360004",
    "track_id": "36",
    "begin_time": "00:00:15,733",
    "end_time": "00:00:20,066",
    "content": "魔法学院，欢迎新生！！"
  },
  {
    "id": "380001",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:38,433",
    "end_time": "00:00:39,466",
    "content": "希露德"
  },
  {
    "id": "380002",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:40,000",
    "end_time": "00:00:40,766",
    "content": "珂赛特"
  },
  {
    "id": "380003",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:41,366",
    "end_time": "00:00:42,133",
    "content": "裘卡"
  },
  {
    "id": "380004",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:43,866",
    "end_time": "00:00:45,066",
    "content": "大家"
  },
  {
    "id": "380005",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:45,400",
    "end_time": "00:00:49,066",
    "content": "这一幕，是那么熟悉"
  },
  {
    "id": "380006",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:51,000",
    "end_time": "00:00:52,600",
    "content": "200年前的那一天"
  },
  {
    "id": "380007",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:53,833",
    "end_time": "00:00:55,866",
    "content": "也是你们三个傻傻的家伙"
  },
  {
    "id": "380008",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:56,433",
    "end_time": "00:00:57,966",
    "content": "守护在我的身前"
  },
  {
    "id": "380009",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:00:58,600",
    "end_time": "00:00:59,966",
    "content": "我全都想起来了"
  },
  {
    "id": "380010",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:01,533",
    "end_time": "00:01:02,200",
    "content": "纵然"
  },
  {
    "id": "380011",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:02,633",
    "end_time": "00:01:05,000",
    "content": "我们谁都无法独自战胜噩梦"
  },
  {
    "id": "380012",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:05,433",
    "end_time": "00:01:07,466",
    "content": "但最终让我们走向胜利的"
  },
  {
    "id": "380013",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:08,166",
    "end_time": "00:01:09,766",
    "content": "一定不是一个人的力量"
  },
  {
    "id": "380014",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:11,466",
    "end_time": "00:01:13,600",
    "content": "不仅是小格里芬举起了星盘"
  },
  {
    "id": "380015",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:14,266",
    "end_time": "00:01:15,866",
    "content": "所有孩子们的愿力"
  },
  {
    "id": "380016",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:16,333",
    "end_time": "00:01:18,766",
    "content": "一起汇聚成了最耀眼的光芒"
  },
  {
    "id": "380017",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:19,800",
    "end_time": "00:01:21,200",
    "content": "击退了黑暗"
  },
  {
    "id": "380018",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:25,133",
    "end_time": "00:01:26,666",
    "content": "原来战胜噩梦的力量"
  },
  {
    "id": "380019",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:28,033",
    "end_time": "00:01:28,833",
    "content": "就是"
  },
  {
    "id": "380020",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:30,966",
    "end_time": "00:01:32,833",
    "content": "魔法学院的孩子们"
  },
  {
    "id": "380021",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:33,566",
    "end_time": "00:01:38,133",
    "content": "200年前我们曾以愿力之辉封印冥古龙"
  },
  {
    "id": "380022",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:38,933",
    "end_time": "00:01:41,400",
    "content": "而今，历史再次回响"
  },
  {
    "id": "380023",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:42,233",
    "end_time": "00:01:43,600",
    "content": "但我能感受到"
  },
  {
    "id": "380024",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:44,233",
    "end_time": "00:01:47,533",
    "content": "这片土地的愿力远比过往澎湃"
  },
  {
    "id": "380025",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:48,266",
    "end_time": "00:01:49,133",
    "content": "此刻"
  },
  {
    "id": "380026",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:49,766",
    "end_time": "00:01:53,866",
    "content": "我们已然拥有驱散噩梦的真正力量"
  },
  {
    "id": "380027",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:55,466",
    "end_time": "00:01:57,133",
    "content": "请举起你们的双手"
  },
  {
    "id": "380028",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:58,000",
    "end_time": "00:01:59,366",
    "content": "将你们的勇气"
  },
  {
    "id": "380029",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:01:59,933",
    "end_time": "00:02:00,900",
    "content": "信念"
  },
  {
    "id": "380030",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:01,500",
    "end_time": "00:02:02,866",
    "content": "与精灵的牵绊"
  },
  {
    "id": "380031",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:03,666",
    "end_time": "00:02:05,533",
    "content": "守护彼此的心愿"
  },
  {
    "id": "380032",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:06,266",
    "end_time": "00:02:08,000",
    "content": "尽数托付于我"
  },
  {
    "id": "380033",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:11,566",
    "end_time": "00:02:12,666",
    "content": "我"
  },
  {
    "id": "380034",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:13,166",
    "end_time": "00:02:14,266",
    "content": "芙蕾雅"
  },
  {
    "id": "380035",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:15,133",
    "end_time": "00:02:17,566",
    "content": "以魔法学院守护者之名"
  },
  {
    "id": "380036",
    "track_id": "38",
    "begin_time": "00:02:18,633",
    "end_time": "00:02:22,200",
    "content": "唤醒精灵王之魂！"
  },
  {
    "id": "490001",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:00,033",
    "end_time": "00:00:01,800",
    "content": "它们说，总觉得背后有一双眼睛"
  },
  {
    "id": "490002",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:01,900",
    "end_time": "00:00:03,833",
    "content": "可每次回头，除了冷风，什么也没有"
  },
  {
    "id": "490003",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:04,000",
    "end_time": "00:00:06,000",
    "content": "每到夜里，头顶会有巨大的阴影扫过"
  },
  {
    "id": "490004",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:06,067",
    "end_time": "00:00:08,000",
    "content": "冰冷的羽毛几乎贴着后颈拂过"
  },
  {
    "id": "490005",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:08,133",
    "end_time": "00:00:09,300",
    "content": "就像……在挑选猎物"
  },
  {
    "id": "490006",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:09,767",
    "end_time": "00:00:13,500",
    "content": "哪怕是白天，走着走着……"
  },
  {
    "id": "490007",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:14,667",
    "end_time": "00:00:16,033",
    "content": "身边的伙伴就突然不见了"
  },
  {
    "id": "490008",
    "track_id": "49",
    "begin_time": "00:00:16,333",
    "end_time": "00:00:17,667",
    "content": "像是凭空消失了一样"
  },
  {
    "id": "560017",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:46,450",
    "end_time": "00:00:50,383",
    "content": "为世间所有的幽暗，带去光明"
  },
  {
    "id": "560016",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:44,816",
    "end_time": "00:00:46,283",
    "content": "像一颗太阳"
  },
  {
    "id": "560015",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:42,383",
    "end_time": "00:00:44,483",
    "content": "那把剑始终在那里"
  },
  {
    "id": "560014",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:40,083",
    "end_time": "00:00:42,150",
    "content": "在不为人知的角落"
  },
  {
    "id": "560013",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:34,983",
    "end_time": "00:00:39,350",
    "content": "但光明照耀下心中的光火，却不肯熄灭"
  },
  {
    "id": "560012",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:30,283",
    "end_time": "00:00:34,683",
    "content": "即便，那颗闪亮的晨星在悄然间坠落"
  },
  {
    "id": "560011",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:27,350",
    "end_time": "00:00:29,550",
    "content": "与最好的孩子的故事"
  },
  {
    "id": "560010",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:25,016",
    "end_time": "00:00:27,350",
    "content": "写下了最伟大的国王"
  },
  {
    "id": "560009",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:20,550",
    "end_time": "00:00:24,850",
    "content": "从此，此剑与光明王随他征战四方"
  },
  {
    "id": "560008",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:18,450",
    "end_time": "00:00:20,216",
    "content": "送入他的掌心"
  },
  {
    "id": "560007",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:16,150",
    "end_time": "00:00:18,450",
    "content": "将湖中剑缓缓升起"
  },
  {
    "id": "560006",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:14,050",
    "end_time": "00:00:16,016",
    "content": "光明王也落入瀑布"
  },
  {
    "id": "560005",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:10,783",
    "end_time": "00:00:13,816",
    "content": "当纯粹之心融化了所有太阳"
  },
  {
    "id": "560004",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:07,383",
    "end_time": "00:00:10,150",
    "content": "曾为他降下过九个太阳的考验"
  },
  {
    "id": "560003",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:06,083",
    "end_time": "00:00:07,383",
    "content": "阿瓦隆世界"
  },
  {
    "id": "560002",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:03,216",
    "end_time": "00:00:05,950",
    "content": "那个男孩还未成为国王前"
  },
  {
    "id": "560001",
    "track_id": "56",
    "begin_time": "00:00:00,983",
    "end_time": "00:00:02,750",
    "content": "凌空九日！"
  },
  {
    "id": "550016",
    "track_id": "55",
    "begin_time": "00:00:52,466",
    "end_time": "00:00:55,133",
    "content": "他，永不后退！"
  },
  {
    "id": "550015",
    "track_id": "55",
    "begin_time": "00:00:48,733",
    "end_time": "00:00:51,866",
    "content": "举起辉烬长枪的骑士，总会记得"
  },
  {
    "id": "550014",
    "track_id": "55",
    "begin_time": "00:00:44,566",
    "end_time": "00:00:48,466",
    "content": "往后此生，无论再面对怎样的对手"
  },
  {
    "id": "550013",
    "track_id": "55",
    "begin_time": "00:00:40,133",
    "end_time": "00:00:44,000",
    "content": "将那枚光焰锻入了自己最趁手的武器"
  },
  {
    "id": "550012",
    "track_id": "55",
